concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-70-2-ss-3 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-70-2-ss-3-logic-ltl-4 .
