    values:originalText "The amendments of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1997 made by this Part apply to a loss or outgoing incurred on or after the commencement of Part 1 of this Schedule. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 22 June 2023 Senate on 6 September 2023] (135/22)" ;
